Description: CenterClick NTP250 configuration for mainline Linux and chrony
 Units, scripts and settings for the NTP250 (ROCK Pi S on the CHRONOS
 carrier): kernel and U-Boot boot menus, GPS setup, PPS refclock, front
 panel, firewall, mDNS, timing tweaks and unattended upgrades.
